   $q$How does the tone of Text 1 differ from the tone of Text 2?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Text 1 is bitter and angry from start to finish, while Text 2 is fearful and full of regret.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"Text 1 is humorous and doubtful though slowly won over, while Text 2 is eager and celebratory throughout.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Text 1 is eager and celebratory throughout, while Text 2 is humorous and doubtful at first.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-texts"},{"text":"Both texts share the same serious, formal tone of a report written for town officials.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Text 1 is humorous and doubtful though slowly won over, while Text 2 is eager and celebratory throughout.$q$, $q$The columnist jokes about nearly being "delivered to the next county" and claims to remain a skeptic, yet admits "I understood." The poem's speaker never doubts the bicycle, so it is not the text that starts out doubtful.$q$, 'draft', '4e2a7710-3c30-5026-9fce-daa8a90a602a')
