   $q$Which theme do the two texts share?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Patient work done now can protect the land for the future, even when results come slowly.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Neighbors usually know best, so newcomers should follow their advice about farming.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"Nature cannot be changed by human effort, so people should accept whatever happens.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Young people work harder than adults when a family faces a difficult season.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Patient work done now can protect the land for the future, even when results come slowly.$q$, $q$Nadia keeps watering and replanting as the marks climb slowly, and the speaker plants for a child who will find "the ground still holding fast." Both texts reject the doubting neighbor, so the neighbor is not shown to know best.$q$, 'draft', '10e9d0cb-9c22-509a-b6de-4a81b532ed66')
